content.text:
I've emailed Ethan Brooks asking for the completion date of the sale. That's the one thing we need before we can ask Northmere Insurance to cancel the policy on 120 Beech Walk.

In the same email I told him:
- his solicitor or conveyancer can confirm the date if he isn't sure;
- the home needs to stay insured until completion, so cover shouldn't end any earlier;
- once he sends the date, we'll pass it to Northmere and tell him what they say about the cancellation and any refund.

I haven't contacted Northmere yet, and the case is still open while we wait for his reply.
